            "review_text": "Nguyen Anh\n1 contribution\n0\nNice taste\nNov 2019\nI love Korean Food and this restaurant offers authentic Korean Food! I ordered the Kimchi Stew with pork served with rice (for 150,000 VND). It was spicy and fulfilling! \nTheir staff are incredibly polite and helpful! \nThey also serve sashimi and sushi if you’re a fan of Japanese food\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 4, 2019",
